opencode-routing-suite is an opencode port of the task-aware reasoning-mode
router from:

  https://github.com/yjh051108/dsh-routing-suite
  preset submodule: dsh-router-standard (router-core.mjs — classifier + personas)

The task classifier (REACT_RE / SPEC_RE keyword counting), the spec/react
personas, and the measured three-band quantization (spec [0, 0.15] stable,
transition band to avoid, react [0.5, 1] stable) are derived from that
project. The spec persona and the RL-alignment claim come from the official
DeepSeek Harness `minimal` preset snapshot.

Acknowledgments (per upstream):

- xiaobright/modeltest — Project2 / V4.1b evaluation methodology
- xiaobright/dsh-anchored-standard — two-phase anchoring mechanism

